      "content": "been out 8 months now. thought it would feel different. thought I'd feel like myself again once I got out but I just feel like a ghost. my old neighborhood, my old street — I walked past my old house yesterday. some other family living there now. kids in the yard. I just kept walking. didn't know what else to do\n\nI don't think there's a version of this world that has me in it anymore. not really. everything just kept going without me and now I'm just kind of... drifting through spaces that used to mean something",
