    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I appreciate it saying that but \"you're not alone\" doesn't really land when I am. like objectively. my parents died while I was inside. my ex moved on, my kids don't return calls. I live in a halfway house with guys I don't know. \n\nI'm not saying this to complain. it's just the facts. I did something wrong and now this is what my life is. I'm not sure I'm supposed to be anywhere specifically. like maybe there just isn't a place for me in any of this anymore",
